职位要求

1.无工作经验硬性要求，有充电网络研究经验者优先;

2.具有较强主观能动性、快速学习能力，能够协作多部门推动复杂项目落地;

3.掌握良好的结构化思维，有独立完整的市场策略、政策研究、产业链研究经验(具备其一即可，具备多项经验者加分)，能为业务输出可落地的策略建议；

4.良好的业务sense，愿意深入一线发现问题，解决问题。

1. Has work experience in AI technology companies, and is familiar with the product development processes and innovation models of cutting-edge technology enterprises;

2. Has design experience in AI-related products (such as generative AI, autonomous driving, intelligent assistants, voice interaction, etc.), and is able to independently complete the design and delivery of complex AI hardware product functions;

3. Possesses strategic and systematic thinking, capable of driving product innovation and achieving business goals through design;

4. Excellent English communication skills, able to adapt to cross-cultural and cross-time zone teamwork.

